OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785156513
OL,3,CTeenager charged over 'bomb hoax' at
OL,4,CPeter Kay show appears in court
OL,6,FA 19-year-old, who was charged over an
OL,7,Falleged bomb hoax which forced a Peter
OL,8,FKay comedy show in Birmingham to be
OL,9,Fevacuated, has appeared in court.
OL,11,FOmar Majed appeared at Birmingham
OL,12,FCrown Court via video-link from HMP
OL,13,FBrinsford on Monday (July 27th).
OL,15,FMajed, who wore a grey prison t-shirt
OL,16,Fand tracksuit bottoms, did not speak
OL,17,Fduring the hearing, choosing only to
OL,18,Fnod when asked to confirm his identity
OL,19,Fby the court clerk.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/6
