FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785156513
OL,3,CTeenager charged over 'bomb hoax' at
OL,4,CPeter Kay show appears in court
OL,6,FSat at a table next to a prison
OL,7,Fofficer, Majed grinned during the
OL,8,Fshort hearing with his arms crossed
OL,9,Fand put his head down on the table
OL,10,Fmultiple times.
OL,12,FA pre-trial review hearing for Majed
OL,13,Ffrom Birmingham, who was charged with
OL,14,Fcommunicating false information to
OL,15,Fpolice contrary to the Criminal Law
OL,16,FAct, was set for September 30th.
OL,18,FThe defendant has not yet been
OL,19,Farraigned due to the need for
OL,20,Fpsychiatric reports.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785156513
OL,3,CTeenager charged over 'bomb hoax' at
OL,4,CPeter Kay show appears in court
OL,6,FAt a previous hearing, which was cut
OL,7,Fshort after Majed started to take his
OL,8,Fclothes off, a trial date was set for
OL,9,FNovember 3rd.
OL,11,FAddressing the defendant, Judge Smith
OL,12,Fsaid: "You will next appear before
OL,13,Fthis court on September 30 this year.
OL,15,F"Between now and then, various doctors
OL,16,Fwill need to speak to you and you
OL,17,Fshould co-operate with these doctors.
OL,19,F"You will, between now and September
OL,20,F30, remain in custody as you currently
OL,21,Fare."
OL,26,@tD@GOUwD@AOU{D@AOU}D@EO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
