OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785156513
OL,3,CTeenager charged over 'bomb hoax' at
OL,4,CPeter Kay show appears in court
OL,6,FAt the end of the hearing, Majed stood
OL,7,Fup and appeared to bow multiple times
OL,8,Fbefore the link with the prison was
OL,9,Fcut.
OL,11,FKay, 52, was ushered off stage during
OL,12,Fhis show at the Utilita Arena in
OL,13,FBirmingham on May 1st and the show was
OL,14,Fcancelled after the evacuation.
OL,16,FWest Midlands Police later said
OL,17,F"nothing suspicious was found" during
OL,18,Fsearches.
OL,26,@yD@AOUyD@^O]
