CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785156513
OL,3,CTeenager charged over 'bomb hoax' at
OL,4,CPeter Kay show appears in court
OL,6,FIn an update on May 2nd, the force
OL,7,Fsaid: "An evacuation of the arena was
OL,8,Fordered yesterday evening after a
OL,9,Freport of a suspicious bag being left
OL,10,Fin the area.
OL,12,F"Following searches, nothing
OL,13,Fsuspicious was found and we are
OL,14,Fgrateful to everyone for their co-
OL,15,Foperation and understanding.
OL,17,F"As always, our priority is the safety
OL,18,Fof the public."
OL,26,@oD@GOUtD@AOUyD@AOUzD@OO]
