OL,3,CTeenager charged over 'bomb hoax' at
OL,4,CPeter Kay show appears in court
OL,6,FThe show was part of Kay's Better Late
OL,7,FThan Never national tour, which will
OL,8,Fsee all proceeds donated to 12 cancer
OL,9,Fcharities.
